          "text": "Wounded traveler: a man of about 30 to 45 years, of average build with a lean, weathered frame, olive skin, short dark hair and a close-cut beard. Facial features are plain and worn, marked with dust and bruising. Stripped to a simple loincloth of undyed linen, he has no cloak or sandals. Signature props: none."
